  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd the `set_operation_coolant` entry to the MCP skill.\nDocument its required arguments, five coolant modes, aliases, undo behavior, and named refusals.\nExplain when the tool sets a mode with a warning and the post refuses it.\nAdd a documentation pin and a decision record.\n\n## Cause\n\nPR #974 shipped the MCP tool without its skill entry.\n\n## Tests\n\n`python3 .claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/tests/test_coolant.py` passes.\n`CoolantSkill.test_coolant_tool_row_matches_schema_and_explains_refusals` failed before the fix because the row was missing.\nThe pin compares the documented arguments and modes with the Rust schema.\nRestoring the old upstream skill made the pin fail.\nRestoring the fixed skill made it pass.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed with 0 steps and 0 failures.\nThe gate selected no Rust tests because no Rust crate changed.\nClippy is not applicable because no Rust crate changed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThis change does not exercise runtime MCP behavior or physical machines.\nThe quick gate does not discover the Python pin.\nWe ran that pin manually.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPRs #2187, #2149, #2136, #2134, #2092, #2089, #2083, #2037, and #1738 change other tool entries in the MCP skill.\nEach touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nEffort: low\n\nChangelog: Document operation coolant MCP parameters and refusals in the agent skill.\n\nFixes #1337\n",
